load @term/seed/code/number/rational
  find rational

# A ratio: the comparison of two quantities by division, one number as a multiple of another, the seed of the rational
# numbers. The golden ratio, the growth rate of the pentagrid's Fibonacci tree, is the ratio a length has to its larger
# part when that equals the part's ratio to the whole. The form carries the rationals the ratio lives among.
form ratio
  link field, like rational
